# Predictive Modeler report

## Task

Forecast the monthly chocolate search-interest target for the next twelve months at prediction time after the observed history, using only the target's historical values and calendar features, with monthly-start frequency (MS), chronological evaluation, complete 12-step forecast horizons, no future-target leakage, and evaluation seed 42 for randomized fitting/splitting where applicable.

## Outcome

Status: succeeded. Stop reason: budget_exhausted.

## Agent rationale

All 3 allowed candidates were trained and evaluated on frozen chronological 12-step folds. The regularized linear lag model had the lowest mean validation MAE (6.1681), improving on seasonal naive (7.25) and last-value baseline (11.1944), so it is selected; no further trials remain within the budget.

